message: "Copyright Prasad Subrahmanya (https://prasad.tech). If you use this dataset or the checker, please cite it as below."
title: "Agent Files Index: features of public AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md and SKILL.md files"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Subrahmanya
    given-names: Prasad
    website: "https://prasad.tech"
version: "2026.11"
date-released: "2026-11-15"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/prasadus92/agent-files-index"
url: "https://prasad.tech/blog/agent-files-index/"
abstract: >-
  Structural features of agent instruction files (AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, SKILL.md) in public
  GitHub repositories: a census of repos with 1,000 or more stars pushed in the 12 months to
  15 November 2026, plus a self-weighting 5% day sample of repos with 100 to 999 stars. Published
  as derived features only (no file text), with a lint checker whose rules come from the data and
  from published guidance. The checker code is MIT licensed.
keywords:
  - AGENTS.md
  - CLAUDE.md
  - SKILL.md
  - coding agents
  - context files
  - dataset
  - linter
